  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 6th level, you've learned how to apply your Experimental Medicine as regenerative medicine. As an action on your turn, you can expend one use of your Experimental Medicine and create a cloud of medical fumes that can restore a number of hit points equal to five times your medic level. Choose any creatures within 30 feet of you, and divide those hit points among them. You can't use this feature on an Undead or a Construct.</p>",
